'''Pigge Victorious''' (合格野郎, ''Gōkaku Yarō'', '''Qualified Bastard''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy introduced in [[FINALS WEEK#Go Go Graduates!|Go Go Graduates!]]. They were added in [[Version 6.9 Update|Version 6.9]].

