==Enemy==
Pigge Victorious looks similar to [[Pigge Back]], with some differences including the [[Doge]]s wearing headbands, the [[Pigge]] wearing a black school uniform, and being upside down.

This enemy isn't very threatening and will mostly act as a "meatshield" for the other enemies in its respective stages.

==Strategy==
Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]], especially [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], to make quick work of Pigge Victorious.

